# `control::Pid::ki`

[Back to `control::Pid`](../PidController.md)

The integral gain `Ki`.

## Signature

```cpp
const pluss::Series& control::Pid::ki() const noexcept;
```

## What It Does

Returns the integral gain `Ki` as a `Series`, stored as given to `pid` (promoted to the common floating dtype of the four gains). A single controller holds one element; a batch of controllers holds one element per controller on the leading axes. Read it to check what was configured or to rebuild the controller with one value changed.

## Returns

A reference to the stored integral gain `Ki`.

## Practical Examples

### Example 1

A controller with `Kp = 2`, `Ki = 1`, `Kd = 0.5`.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

namespace ctl = pluss::subsp::eng::control;
using namespace pluss::tils;

static pluss::Series s(double v) { return pluss::make_series(v); }
static ctl::Pid controller(double ts = 0.0, ctl::PidRule i = ctl::PidRule::Forward, ctl::PidRule d = ctl::PidRule::Forward) {
  return ctl::pid(s(2.0), s(1.0), s(0.5), s(0.1), ts, i, d);
}

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(4));
  const ctl::Pid c = controller();
  out.writeln("ki =", c.ki().item<double>());
}
```

### Example 2

`Ki = 0` removes the integral action, leaving a PD controller.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

namespace ctl = pluss::subsp::eng::control;
using namespace pluss::tils;

static pluss::Series s(double v) { return pluss::make_series(v); }
static ctl::Pid controller(double ts = 0.0, ctl::PidRule i = ctl::PidRule::Forward, ctl::PidRule d = ctl::PidRule::Forward) {
  return ctl::pid(s(2.0), s(1.0), s(0.5), s(0.1), ts, i, d);
}

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(4));
  const ctl::Pid c = ctl::pid(s(2.0), s(0.0), s(0.5), s(0.1));
  out.writeln("ki =", c.ki().item<double>());
}
```

### Example 3

The integral gain next to the other two.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

namespace ctl = pluss::subsp::eng::control;
using namespace pluss::tils;

static pluss::Series s(double v) { return pluss::make_series(v); }
static ctl::Pid controller(double ts = 0.0, ctl::PidRule i = ctl::PidRule::Forward, ctl::PidRule d = ctl::PidRule::Forward) {
  return ctl::pid(s(2.0), s(1.0), s(0.5), s(0.1), ts, i, d);
}

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(4));
  const ctl::Pid c = controller();
  out.writeln("kp", c.kp().item<double>(), " ki", c.ki().item<double>(), " kd", c.kd().item<double>());
}
```

